{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:InformationTheory.OperationalEntropy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"InformationTheory.OperationalEntropy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Units.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.hausdorff_eq_entropy_mul_lyapunov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.hausdorff_eq_entropy_mul_lyapunov","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/operational-entropy.lean#L40-L48","doc":"Operational entropy relates to Hausdorff dimension via\nd_{H,q} = η_q · (2q - 1). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.qHausdorffDimension","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.qHausdorffDimension","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/operational-entropy.lean#L35-L38","doc":"The q-deformed Hausdorff dimension d_{H,q} = η_q / χ_q = (2q-1)² · q⁻³. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.operationalEntropy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.operationalEntropy","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/operational-entropy.lean#L26-L33","doc":"**Operational entropy** of the Reeb dynamics at substrate parameter q.\n\nη_q := (2q - 1) · q⁻³\n\nMeasures the information generated per f_q-iteration in nats. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:operational-entropy","label":"def:operational-entropy","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/operational-entropy.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}